text Ever since Nagisa told me about her play.
text ──"It's about a girl who's the only person left in the entire world."
text I feel like I've seen something like that before.
text When could it have been?
text And what was it?
text A dream? Or was I really there myself?
text I can't remember anything about it at all.
text But Nagisa's words felt strangely familiar.
text They felt like this scene that I'd witnessed before.
