	fi
fi
text While I poke fun at her with my words, I feel shaken.
text What she said about a doll made out of junk caused me to conjure up a strong mental image that pierces through my heart.
text What could this feeling be?
text I just have to know where this story came from.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG10AZ"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG10AZ.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KDK.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But that's all I can remember. So if I perform it as a play, it would have to end there.
text @[Tomoya]
text Again, that'd be boring. You're a bad listener, you know that?
sound KDL.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I'd be able to perform it by myself if that's all there is.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, yes. You'd be the only person in the world, after all.
text @[Tomoya]
text But then you'd just be making a doll, and then ─The End. Right?
text @[Tomoya]
text There's no development to the story. It's not exciting unless there's some sort of climax.
text @[Tomoya]
text And if it's not exciting, then the audience won't enjoy it.
text @[Tomoya]
text Your goal with the play is to have an audience watch it. That'd make it an awful production.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG32A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG32A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KDM.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Would it...?
text Hearing her depressed voice makes me realize that we had suddenly switched to talking about her play.
text @[Tomoya]
text In any case, let's find out what happens next. I bet if we do, it'll become a really moving story, just like you say it is.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG12A"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG12A.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound KDN.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But how do we do that?
text @[Tomoya]
text You have something like a closet or a storage room around here, don't you? We'll look around in places that might have old stuff laying around.
