text We start looking through the storage room in the afternoon.
sound KDO.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Wow! I can't believe what I found!
text It's rare to hear Nagisa raise her voice so much.
text @[Tomoya]
text What is it?
sound KDP.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Please take a look.
text She smiles as she brings out...
text ...A Dango keychain.
sound KDQ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I put this on my bookbag when I was in elementary school.
sound KDR.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text It really takes me back.
sound KDS.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I want to put this on my bag for school again.
text @[Tomoya]
text Gah...
text But then I'd have to walk next to someone doing that...
text @[Tomoya]
text You need to grow out of this kind of stuff.
sound KDT.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Excuse me? It's cute.
sound KDU.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Dango, dango!
text After that, she's so busy singing that we don't make any further progress.
text Just as I'm ready to give up...
sound KDV.aac
text @[Akio]
text Who's that in the storage closet singing embarrassing songs?
text The old man shows up.
text @[Tomoya]
text Your daughter, that's who.
sound KDW.aac
text @[Akio]
text Oh, Nagisa. It's you.
sound KDX.aac
text @[Akio]
text What're you doing here?
sound KDY.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text We're looking for something.
sound KDZ.aac
text @[Akio]
text For what? Just tell your trusty ol' dad and he'll find it for you, my daughter!
sound KE0.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Now that you mention it... What is it that we're looking for?
text Nagisa looks at me.
text @[Tomoya]
text A memento of yours.
sound KE1.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That's right. Something that holds my memories.
sound KE2.aac
text @[Akio]
text You won't find it here.
text He replies to her coldly.
sound KE3.aac
text @[Akio]
text All you'll find here is a bunch of dumb junk.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's fine. I want to look regardless.
sound KE4.aac
text @[Akio]
text Don't. There's nothing to find.
sound KE5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I found this.
text She shows him the keychain.
sound KE6.aac
text @[Akio]
text Er, yeah... I guess so. Okay, there is that. But that's all.
sound KE7.aac
text @[Akio]
text So go back inside.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
sound KE8.aac
text @[Akio]
text You youngsters act your age and go flirt in your room or something.
sound KE9.aac
text @[Akio]
text Hold on, why am I telling you to do something like that?!
sound KEA.aac
text @[Akio]
text I'll snip it right off your body, you bastard!
text @[Tomoya]
text Snip what...?
sound KEB.aac
text @[Akio]
text Eh, just get out of here.
text He grabs me by the arm and tosses me out.
